},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"5c9c4dbfee59786e9986e5b62b0fe5bbcb3a5ad899543837532750e89da5b7b6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_key_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"7a402f6d196a90eb634afadf556392e9bf373e2be0d48d5f06554468d489a0ec","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_key_secondary2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"2ca9704f43d92949429f8f2a24d14f67232b7a8fb51d5bf166dffccacc434067","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_other_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"96a84653cf6d1348916ceb15f0ff4db3aa2ea6561a7aec7f1f4c5db4803356ac","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_other_secondary2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。","quote_sha256":"530974bd02c3eb232b06727479f0772e51161f6dc7b822bcf0871b121ab20cae","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"e6fe16afc58242d2ca9effeb0c5a7f752ec3997fb7fdd84684e2b7c202eb4492","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_safety2"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sp_pkt_sec3","sp_sd_primary_obj","sp_sd_secondary_obj","sp_sd_primary_endpoint","sp_sd_key_secondary","sp_sd_key_secondary2","sp_sd_other_secondary","sp_sd_other_secondary2","sp_sd_safety","sp_sd_safety2"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":9},"heading":"研究目的和终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为确证性III期临床研究，目标人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，研究目的包括评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂的疗效与安全性。主要目的为评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效，主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。次要目的为评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响，关键次要终点为第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例和第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例，其他次要终点为第16周PASI评分较基线的变化和第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","rationale":"本节内容依据已确认的主要研究目的、次要研究目的以及主要、关键次要、其他次要和安全性终点归纳；未新增研究程序或评价时点。建议医学作者核对终点名称与统计章节的一致性。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究目的和终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cc81ab6b8717128e","section_number":"3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c4a8664ecae277aef4acbb75","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922052345_22c5ef22","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:c4a8664ecae277aef4acbb75","quote":"章节编号=3.1\n章节标题=主要目的和主要终点","quote_sha256":"ce5f2295260cfdfb4ed7e3850bf3c7e787b2f4efa98962212dc7695be6d96b11","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:c4a8664ecae277aef4acbb75","span_id":"sp_pkt_sec31"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:c4a8664ecae277aef4acbb75","quote":"评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。\n第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"785c24946100097df6b48c12b981f28e0a965ec52f779d95bd656d3aede055a9","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:c4a8664ecae277aef4acbb75","span_id":"sp_pkt_31_body"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要研究目的：评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。","quote_sha256":"91f9668c833c01c737e00948c18613521366f596752872eef9fc69a09e681b8f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_primary_obj"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_primary_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略人群为所有随机受试者；比较第16周PASI 75应答。停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补；报告组间率差及95%置信区间。","quote_sha256":"44f71070d9cdb5b6b69ad6feeeb7fbfeef4aad105693eaa3500bedd537f18414","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。","quote_sha256":"e9b17439a1b1c578052cd13dad05d71e672ffe680dded17beb6730e36d09e241","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_superiority"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sp_pkt_sec31","sp_pkt_31_body","sp_sd_primary_obj","sp_sd_primary_endpoint","sp_sd_estimand","sp_sd_superiority"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"主要目的和主要终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"主要目的为评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例，按第16周PASI评分较基线的改善幅度判定。主要估计目标采用治疗策略，分析人群为所有随机受试者；停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补，结果报告组间应答率差及其95%置信区间。统计分析按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。","rationale":"依据已确认的主要研究目的、主要终点、估计目标策略和优效性分析目标撰写；救援治疗目前仅作为估计目标中判定无应答的表述出现，其定义与实施规则需医学作者核对。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（主要目的和主要终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db5f25e7dd5b8877","section_number":"3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c4a8664ecae277aef4acbb75","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922052345_22c5ef22","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_9e670d193fbbb761","fact_path":"picos.exploratory_objectives","options":[{"label":"本研究不设置探索性目的","option_id":"opt_no_exploratory_objective","summary":"将“本研究不设置探索性目的”直接写入探索性目的字段，不新增探索性分析程序。"},{"label":"评价合成试验药A在成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者中第4周、第8周及第12周的早期PASI 75应答特征","option_id":"opt_early_pasi_objective","summary":"探索性目的填写为：评价合成试验药A在成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者中第4周、第8周及第12周的早期PASI 75应答特征。数据来自方案已安排的PASI评价时点，不新增访视或检查。"}],"question":"本研究是否设置探索性目的？","rationale":"已确认研究事实的次要目的与终点之外未列明探索性目的；如本研究不新增探索性程序，可直接确认不设置。","recommended_option_id":"opt_no_exploratory_objective"},{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_9e670d193fbbb761","fact_path":"picos.exploratory_endpoints","options":[{"label":"本研究不设置探索性终点","option_id":"opt_no_exploratory_endpoint","summary":"