ition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_multicenter"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者","quote_sha256":"a1f2b59730f1d08cde8f6a85d4179e62887b3729f4175c98334b9dafda33e808","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_random"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。","quote_sha256":"4b72f3388e7586f2bc754d65df1ff638f98aed04e4f3067823942002abba8ed1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_dosing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量策略：假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例（每组66例）。","quote_sha256":"2088842f2548655845b43f017bb904dc2663a94d1a5c7a802e7adf8daa68b0d2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_sample"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"5ae71042624bdf9379739b82f94638e918fd984fb8f52ecffa5abb278e3f2533","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_no_interim"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"913a62236e4f4332a7188562f2625d53aa7f770cea155664564c5fb821a98efd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_no_reext"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_compliance"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_admin"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_formulation"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_tech"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sp_pkt_sec4","sp_sd_phase","sp_sd_purpose","sp_sd_design","sp_sd_multicenter","sp_sd_population","sp_sd_random","sp_sd_intervention","sp_sd_dosing","sp_sd_periods","sp_sd_visits","sp_sd_sample","sp_sd_no_interim","sp_sd_no_reext","sp_sd_compliance","sp_sd_admin","sp_sd_formulation","sp_sd_tech"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":17},"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组III期临床研究，采用确证性研究设计，目标人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，以第16周PASI 75应答率作为主要疗效终点。受试者于基线/第1天按1:1比例随机分配至试验组或对照组，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服、每日一次，对照组接受匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗期为16周。研究包括最长4周的筛选期、16周的双盲治疗期和4周的安全性随访期；筛选后于基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访，PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。计划入组132例受试者，每组66例；不开展期中分析，也不计划进行样本量再估计。双盲治疗期内通过药品计数及受试者日记评价受试者依从性。合成试验药A为口服固体制剂，属小分子药物，经口服途径全身给药。","rationale":"依据已确认的研究分期、内在研究目的、总体研究设计、中心模式、随机与对照设置、给药方案、研究时期、访视策略、样本量策略及依从性评价方式撰写；建议医学作者核对各访视时间窗与后续章节的一致性。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1741b1557c67abd7","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c4a8664ecae277aef4acbb75","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21